n\u003cul class=\"parameter__list 251788 active\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003eLoại máy: \u003cspan class=\"comma\"\u003eMáy khuếch tán tinh dầu\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMáy tạo độ ẩm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003ePhạm vi: \u0026lt;\u003cspan\u003e35m²\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003eCông suất: \u003cspan\u003e25W\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003eDung tích: \u003cspan\u003e5 lít\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003eTốc độ phun: \u003cspan\u003e350 ml/h\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003eBảng điều khiển: \u003cspan\u003eNút xoay\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003eTiện ích: \u003cspan class=\"comma\"\u003eCảnh báo sắp hết nước, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTự động tắt khi hết nước\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003eKích thước \u0026amp; Khối lượng: \u003cspan\u003eNgang 19 cm - Cao 30 cm - Sâu 18 cm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"lileft\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNặng 1.2 kg\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCông suất 25W có tốc độ phun tối đa 350 ml/h sử dụng phù hợp cho phòng có diện tích dưới 35m²\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eMáy tạo ẩm DEERMA sử dụng khuếch tán hơi nước tạo ẩm cho không khí, cân bằng độ ẩm có lợi cho sức khỏe\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNgoài tạo độ ẩm, người dùng có thể cho thêm tinh dầu trực tiếp vào nước để tạo hương thơm dễ chịu cho không gian sử dụng\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLan tỏa tinh dầu trải rộng, không làm thay đổi tinh chất tinh dầu giúp nâng cao hiệu quả thư giãn, giúp bạn có một không gian tràn ngập mùi hương yêu thích.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLưu ý:\u003c/strong\u003e Chỉ được đổ tinh dầu vào nút cao su màu vàng, không được đổ tinh dầu trực tiếp vào nước.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/89/a9/5c/68e6dcb95a49a97a34669c2ec5a26a2a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a5/b3/60/ef4b964f3fcddf19dd8032ae578e5382.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/27/fb/71/1c9b52a187c821621c1ecd04aa61773f.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ef/14/17/5ed1f3fe366fccfd3cc3bda73bacf242.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/97/83/30/3f8289ca994cf9bdf08036a7dd1f2a59.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/08/47/ea/215b841f6165f7495c33839a5ef95f1f.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f3/d1/77/0cf843a9eb34fc26b8d5c13bfea152c3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1c/9e/f6/a6992565487d10cb15fbbd956bee0945.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1e/7a/9b/c4590e45ee7afe8f9e63bf037ec4186a.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/fb/6d/9c/